.
.  Generate sample output for EV1 PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na ev11pdf.jpg
device 2 gd jpeg
device 2 picture points 100 75
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Extreme Value Type I (Minimum) PDF
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL Probability Density
X1LABEL X
.
SET MINMAX 1
PLOT EV1PDF(X) FOR X = -4 0.01 4
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv ev11pdf.jpg ../gif100/ev11pdf.jpg
.
quit
